Package: querencia-archiv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Querencia Desktop archive manager (alpha)
 Querencia Archiv is the archive manager of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2, modelled on File Roller 2.30: open
 archives as a folder tree, preview and extract files, create zip, tar.gz
 and tar.xz archives and add or remove files.
 .
 Archives are read with the libarchive library (zip, also encrypted, tar
 with all common filters, 7z, RAR 4/5 read-only, ISO, cpio and more).
 Paths outside the target folder and links from an archive are never
 written. The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
